sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Human/Hermes
    participant C as Collaboration Manager
    participant A as Agent A
    participant B as Agent B
    participant G as Event Gateway
    participant L as Ledger/Bus
    participant T as Team State

    H->>C: Goal / TaskContract
    C->>T: Create collaboration + team assignment
    par Independent foreground work
        C->>A: Assignment A
        C->>B: Assignment B
    end
    A->>G: Draft EVIDENCE message for B/team
    G->>G: Validate + firewall + canonicalize
    G->>L: Persist canonical message
    L-->>B: Make P1 message available
    B->>B: Finish current atomic action
    B->>L: Read eligible message at action boundary
    B->>T: Update hypothesis/team projection
    B->>G: CHALLENGE / RESPONSE
    G->>L: Persist + route
    L-->>A: Surface at next boundary
